    <item>
      <title>数据库索引失效的几种情况</title>
      <link>https://yourdomain.com/post/20250824002-%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E5%87%A0%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 24 Aug 2025 16:36:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (5say)</author>
      <guid>https://yourdomain.com/post/20250824002-%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E7%9A%84%E5%87%A0%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>数据库索引失效的几种情况</h1><p>作者：5say（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="一索引失效的核心原理">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%80%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95%e5%a4%b1%e6%95%88%e7%9a%84%e6%a0%b8%e5%bf%83%e5%8e%9f%e7%90%86"></a>
一、索引失效的核心原理
</h1><ul>
<li><strong>索引本质</strong>是 B+ 树（或其他数据结构），查找时要求：
<ul>
<li>索引列直接参与条件</li>
<li>条件支持范围查找或等值查找</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>索引失效</strong>就是 MySQL 优化器决定 <strong>不走索引，全表扫描</strong>。</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h1 id="二常见导致索引失效的情况">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%ba%8c%e5%b8%b8%e8%a7%81%e5%af%bc%e8%87%b4%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95%e5%a4%b1%e6%95%88%e7%9a%84%e6%83%85%e5%86%b5"></a>
二、常见导致索引失效的情况
</h1><h2 id="1-对索引列进行函数表达式运算">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-%e5%af%b9%e7%b4%a2%e5%bc%95%e5%88%97%e8%bf%9b%e8%a1%8c%e5%87%bd%e6%95%b0%e8%a1%a8%e8%be%be%e5%bc%8f%e8%bf%90%e7%ae%97"></a>
1️⃣ 对索引列进行函数/表达式运算
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#f92672">*</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">user</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE</span> DATE(create_time) <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;2025-08-24&#39;</span>;
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#f92672">*</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">user</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE</span> id <span style="color:#f92672">+</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">1</span> <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">101</span>;
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>原因：B+ 树索引存的是列原始值，函数/运算会改变原值 → 无法用树查找</li>
<li>优化：用范围条件替代函数</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE</span> create_time <span style="color:#f92672">&gt;=</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;2025-08-24 00:00:00&#39;</span> 
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>  <span style="color:#66d9ef">AND</span> create_time <span style="color:#f92672">&lt;</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;2025-08-25 00:00:00&#39;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>
<h2 id="2-前置通配符-like">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e5%89%8d%e7%bd%ae%e9%80%9a%e9%85%8d%e7%ac%a6-like"></a>
2️⃣ 前置通配符 LIKE
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#f92672">*</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">user</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE</span> name <span style="color:#66d9ef">LIKE</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;%Alice&#39;</span>;
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>原因：B+ 树索引按字典序存储，前置通配符破坏顺序</li>
<li>优化：
<ul>
<li>改为前缀匹配：<code>LIKE 'Alice%'</code></li>
<li>或使用全文索引/倒排索引</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="3-数据类型不匹配或隐式转换">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e7%b1%bb%e5%9e%8b%e4%b8%8d%e5%8c%b9%e9%85%8d%e6%88%96%e9%9a%90%e5%bc%8f%e8%bd%ac%e6%8d%a2"></a>
3️⃣ 数据类型不匹配或隐式转换
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#f92672">*</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">user</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE</span> id <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;101&#39;</span>;
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>若 <code>id</code> 是 int → MySQL 会把 id 转成字符串或把 &lsquo;101&rsquo; 转成 int</li>
<li>索引可能失效</li>
<li>优化：保证类型一致</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="4-or-条件跨列">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#4-or-%e6%9d%a1%e4%bb%b6%e8%b7%a8%e5%88%97"></a>
4️⃣ OR 条件跨列
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">SELECT</span> <span style="color:#f92672">*</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">FROM</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">user</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">WHERE</span> age<span style="color:#f92672">=</span><span style="color:#ae81ff">20</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">OR</span> name<span style="color:#f92672">=</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;Alice&#39;</span>;
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>
<p>原因：MySQL 对 OR 的优化有限，如果条件跨列且没有覆盖索引，可能走全表</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2025-08-24首发于<a href='https://yourdomain.com/'>5say</a>，最后修改于2025-08-24</p>]]>
      </description>
      
        <category>数据库</category><category>编程</category><category>面试</category>
      
    </item>
    
    

    <item>
      <title>Spring中AI的相关配置</title>
      <link>https://yourdomain.com/post/20250805001-spring%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84ai%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 20:36:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (5say)</author>
      <guid>https://yourdomain.com/post/20250805001-spring%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84ai%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>Spring中AI的相关配置</h1><p>作者：5say（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <p>Spring AI 的配置项是围绕着你选择的 <strong>大模型提供商（Provider）</strong> 来定义的，比如：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>spring.ai.openai</code> → 用于连接 OpenAI / 兼容 OpenAI API 的服务（如 Ollama、LM Studio、FastChat）</li>
<li><code>spring.ai.azure.openai</code> → 连接 Azure OpenAI 服务</li>
<li><code>spring.ai.ollama</code> → 专门为 Ollama 准备（0.8.1 版本后）</li>
<li><code>spring.ai.bedrock</code> → 连接 AWS Bedrock（Claude、Titan 等）</li>
<li><code>spring.ai.transformers</code> → 使用本地 Java 模型（正在开发中）</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="一核心配置结构以-openai-为例">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%80%e6%a0%b8%e5%bf%83%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84%e4%bb%a5-openai-%e4%b8%ba%e4%be%8b"></a>
一、核心配置结构（以 openai 为例）
</h2><h2 id="1-基础结构">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-%e5%9f%ba%e7%a1%80%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%84"></a>
1. 基础结构
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#f92672">spring</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>  <span style="color:#f92672">ai</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#f92672">openai</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>      <span style="color:#f92672">base-url</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">http://localhost:11434/v1    </span> <span style="color:#75715e"># 模型服务 API 地址（Ollama）</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>      <span style="color:#f92672">api-key</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">ollama-local                   </span> <span style="color:#75715e"># 随便写，不会校验</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>      <span style="color:#f92672">chat</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#f92672">model</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">deepseek-r1:8b                 </span> <span style="color:#75715e"># 你要用的模型名（大小写敏感）</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#f92672">temperature</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">0.7</span>                       <span style="color:#75715e"># 随机程度</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#f92672">top-p</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">0.9</span>                             <span style="color:#75715e"># 采样多样性</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#f92672">max-tokens</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">1024</span>                       <span style="color:#75715e"># 最大生成字数</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#f92672">stop</span>: [<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;&lt;|end|&gt;&#34;</span>]                      <span style="color:#75715e"># 停止标记符（可选）</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>      <span style="color:#f92672">embedding</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        <span style="color:#f92672">model</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">text-embedding-ada-002         </span> <span style="color:#75715e"># 嵌入模型名称（如果你要用向量搜索）</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>
<h2 id="2-配置项说明">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae%e9%a1%b9%e8%af%b4%e6%98%8e"></a>
2. 配置项说明
</h2><table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>配置项</th>
          <th>类型</th>
          <th>说明</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td><code>base-url</code></td>
          <td>String</td>
          <td>OpenAI 兼容 API 的基础地址（如 Ollama 是 <code>http://localhost:11434/v1</code>）</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>api-key</code></td>
          <td>String</td>
          <td>API 密钥，Ollama 不验证，可随便写</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>chat.model</code></td>
          <td>String</td>
          <td>聊天模型名称，如 <code>mistral</code>, <code>llama3</code>, <code>deepseek-r1:8b</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>chat.temperature</code></td>
          <td>Float</td>
          <td>控制输出随机性（0 = 更稳定，1 = 更有创意）</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>chat.top-p</code></td>
          <td>Float</td>
          <td>控制生成的多样性（0~1）</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>chat.max-tokens</code></td>
          <td>Integer</td>
          <td>最大生成 token 数量</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>chat.stop</code></td>
          <td>List<!-- raw HTML omitted --></td>
          <td>指定遇到这些字符串就停止生成</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td><code>embedding.model</code></td>
          <td>String</td>
          <td>嵌入模型名称（如果使用向量搜索时需要）</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<hr>
<h2 id="二在spring-中动态地调用不同模型代码中控制">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e4%ba%8c%e5%9c%a8spring-%e4%b8%ad%e5%8a%a8%e6%80%81%e5%9c%b0%e8%b0%83%e7%94%a8%e4%b8%8d%e5%90%8c%e6%a8%a1%e5%9e%8b%e4%bb%a3%e7%a0%81%e4%b8%ad%e6%8e%a7%e5%88%b6"></a>
二、在Spring 中动态地调用不同模型（代码中控制）
</h2><p>你可以不在配置文件中固定写死 <code>model</code>，而是在 Java 代码中动态指定：</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2025-08-08首发于<a href='https://yourdomain.com/'>5say</a>，最后修改于2025-08-08</p>]]>
      </description>
      
